TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_2003_CultofPeace.option3=외계인의 개입 징후가 있는지 조사한다.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_2003_CultofPeace.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_2003_CultofPeace.option3.outcome0=성공.
